arlier but bruce is  forced to face off against guards and  selena gets the chance to confront  palcone she plans on getting revenge for  her roommate's brutal death she also  wants answers about the revelation that  she's felt kony's daughter which  apparently he doesn't know until this  moment it's equally possible that he  simply doesn't care feeling like her  father abandoned her years earlier and  knowing all of the horrors falcone has  committed selena pulls the trigger and  misses this leads father and daughter to  battle head on out in the open while  selena is skilled falcone's ruthlessness  allows him to gain the upper hand during  the confrontation of the club between  falcone and selena she plays the audio  that reveals his direct role in her  roommate's death she was an innocent  woman who just happened to hear too much  falcone strangles her a detail that only  minutes later becomes even more  important selena also reminds falcone of  her mother maria kyle and her death  earlier in the batman selena tells bruce  that her mother was murdered when she  was very young likely by one of the  clients of the club while falcone first  seems to feel some semblance of  emotional connection to selena's  mother's name another horrific truth  comes out as falcone attacks his  daughter he manages to knock her to the  ground and push down on her neck  beginning to strangle her it's at that  point that falcone reveals that he  killed maria the same way if selena  hadn't managed to get away soon after  she would have met the same fate as her  mother and though audiences might root  for selena to take down falcone for good  she decides that justice will be better  served if he lives to suffer the  consequences of his villainy to bruce it  means that selena won't have to hold on  to the trauma that comes from taking  someone's life in the end while it's not  by her own hand selena does see her  father die that night with a face-off  with balcony behind her selena decides  to leave gotham city and start over  somewhere else something bruce probably  should do as well but we all know he  never will check out one of our newest  videos right here plus even more looper  videos about the batman are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]  you

